# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, whose lists live in the process (command.KeptLists): it
# deletes those lists with their scenarios and adds the service over the
# repository (internal/service, its scenarios shared as
# postgres-item-lists-service), internal/infrastructure/postgres (the fixed
# code, the application's tables and migrations), and the migration job
# cmd/migrate. No handler changes: they take what they need of the item lists
# as an interface, which the service has. The base files it changes are the
# composition root, the command scenarios' runner, and the module's build
# files.
base library/architecture/go/vp-http-api-in-go.skill/examples-proto
change cmd/todo/main.go
change internal/command/test/runner_test.go
delete internal/command/kept_lists.go
delete internal/command/features/kept-lists-in-go.feature
delete internal/command/test/kept_lists_steps_test.go
change go.mod
change go.sum
change Makefile
change README.md
